    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22340" root="شطأ" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَطْأَةٌ</span></b>  [app. a n. un. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَطْءٌ</span>, q. v. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also] <i>A
green palm-branch:</i> one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهَا قَدٌّ كَالشَّطْأَةِ</span> <i>She
has a figure like the green palm-branch.</i> (A,
TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A slice,</i> or <i>strip,</i> i. e. <i>a piece cut
lengthwise,</i> of a camel's hump, and of a skin, or
hide. (A, TA.)

